What is ftp service? This service helps you to download and explore files in a ftp server.

✔ Step 1 :
    1 - Enter your ftp address in addressbar.
    2 - Hit connect ( or Ctrl(or Command) + Alt + C ).
    3 - In following dialog enter your username and password for login and then hit ok. (You can leave empty if it's needed)
    4 - Files on ftp server will be shown on left "Explore" list, you can explore through files and double click on them to add to queue.
    5 - Use back button on the left of Explore if needed.
    6 - After adding files to queue, hit Start button ( or Ctrl(or Command) + Alt + S ) to start downloading.
    7 - Your files will be saved on your Desktop, ACD_EXPORTS, ftp folder.